  "bio": "Thomas Gillingham, known to many as 'GILLY', is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in traditional styles based in Swindon, United Kingdom. His work at Phantom Tattoo UK exemplifies a blend of precision and classic flair, making him a sought-after artist for those desiring timeless ink. Gilly's dedication to his craft is evident in each piece he creates, ensuring his clients leave with tattoos that are not only beautiful but also deeply meaningful.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Swindon, England, United Kingdom"
